    <briefdescription>
<para>The firmware release version — one source for every board that reports it. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every board is built from the same release, so there is one version, not one per library. It goes on the wire in two places: <ref refid="namespaceSimGateway" kindref="compound">SimGateway</ref>&apos;s calibration HELLO_ACK, and each STM32 node&apos;s READY_n payload (#295). release-please rewrites the three numbers below when a firmware release PR merges (generic updater, <computeroutput>x-release-please-*</computeroutput> markers; see release-please-config.json) — never edit them by hand.</para>
<para>Shared between STM32 and RP2040. Contains only <computeroutput>#define</computeroutput> constants.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="copyright"><para>GPL-2.0-only — see Firmware/LICENSE </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
